OL,4,G1800FOpera on 3
OL,5,     GFrom the Metropolitan Opera in
OL,6,     GNew York, with Erin Morley in her
OL,7,     GMet debut as Marie and Lawrence
OL,8,     GBrownlee as her admirer Tonio.
OL,9,G2130FMusic Planet
OL,10,     GLopa Kothari pays tribute to the
OL,11,     Glate broadcaster Andy Kershaw;
OL,12,     Gand Fatoumata Diawara shares her
OL,13,     Gtwo Return Journey tracks: one
OL,14,     Gfor the road and one that takes
OL,15,     Gher home.
OL,16,G2230FNew Music Show
OL,17,     GKate Molleson presents music from
OL,18,     GTectonics 2026, the annual
OL,19,     Gfestival curated by Ilan Volkov
OL,20,     Gand the BBC Scottish Symphony
OL,21,     GOrchestra, including a world
OL,22,     Gpremiere by Christopher Fox.
